WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.872
[BEEPING SOUNDS]

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.280
SPEAKER: Google Cloud Pub/Sub
is a messaging service

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.770
for exchanging event
data between applications

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:11.210
and services.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.220
Cloud Pub/Sub is
great for distributing

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:14.690
event notifications.

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:17.960
Take an example of a service
that accepts user sign-ups.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:21.080
It can send notifications
whenever a new user registers,

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.120
and downstream
services can subscribe

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.610
to receive notifications
of the event.

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:28.520
It also allows you to respond
to events as they happen.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:32.540
Cloud Pub/Sub forms part of
Google Cloud's Stream Analytics

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.810
Solution, which provides a
number of useful applications,

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.420
such as performing
sentiment analysis,

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:41.570
identifying general
patterns and trends in data,

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:44.210
monitoring the performance
and reach of campaigns,

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.180
and crafting responses
in real time.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:50.120
The Cloud Pub/Sub lab is
available for use with the G

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:53.180
Cloud command line, as well as
through Google Cloud Platform

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.140
Console.

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:56.510
You can check out the link
to start Quick Labs here,

00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:59.480
and for a limited time, you
can try these labs yourself

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:00.750
for free.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.720
Each of the labs
cover the activities

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:06.050
of setting up a topic to hold
data, subscribing to a topic

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:09.200
to access the data, and then
publishing and consuming

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.480
messages with a poll subscriber.

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:13.760
Next up on our quest
is Cloud Spanner--

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:14.660
Qwik Start.

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:17.110
[MUSIC PLAYING]

